Team 6 | IPP Mini-Project | GitHub Backlog Planning

**GITHUB BACKLOG ****&**** SPRINT PLANNING GUIDE**

*Online Internship **&** Placement Preparation Portal (IPP) | Team 6*

1. Purpose and deadline

This document provides the step-by-step GitHub setup, requirement backlog, proposed story points, balanced task ownership for all four team members, and a two-sprint planning template. The backlog is based on the team's SRS v1.0. The dates provided in the course instruction are: backlog creation and story pointing by 12 October 2026; dry run during 12–16 October 2026; entries may still be revised on 19 October 2026.

