8. Source documents and assumptions

Primary source: Team 6, Software Requirements Specification (SRS), Online Internship & Placement Preparation Portal, Version 1.0, dated 6 September 2026. Functional requirement IDs and NFR/security requirement IDs are retained from that SRS. The uploaded Software Test Plan (STP) was used for the listed team roles/responsibilities. The uploaded Software Architecture and Design Specification (SAD) supports the portal modules and architecture context.

Assumptions: story points and sprint allocations are proposed estimates for team review. The formal sprint dates, team capacity, and exact GitHub usernames were not included in the provided instruction; confirm them with the faculty/team before finalizing.

